WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:03.260
Unit twenty-four. Calm Breathing!

2
00:00:04.233 --> 00:00:07.777
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.827 --> 00:00:11.024
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.074 --> 00:00:14.896
Today we learn about Calm Breathing. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.556 --> 00:00:19.789
Breathe. Say it with me. Breathe!

6
00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.605
Slow. Say it with me. Slow!

7
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.427
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

8
00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:40.125
Nose. Say it with me. Nose!

9
00:00:43.645 --> 00:00:46.961
Mouth. Say it with me. Mouth!

10
00:00:50.494 --> 00:00:53.811
Count. Say it with me. Count!

11
00:00:57.278 --> 00:01:00.962
Relax. Say it with me. Relax!

12
00:01:04.442 --> 00:01:07.459
Feel. Say it with me. Feel!

13
00:01:10.982 --> 00:01:19.557
When I feel upset, I breathe in slowly through my nose and out through my mouth. I count to four each time. Slow breathing helps me relax and feel calm.

14
00:01:19.607 --> 00:01:20.817
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.574 --> 00:01:27.752
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.802 --> 00:01:28.952
Calm!

17
00:01:29.774 --> 00:01:35.216
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.266 --> 00:01:36.416
Relax!

19
00:01:37.522 --> 00:01:43.088
Did you know? Breathing out slowly tells your body that it is safe to calm down!

20
00:01:43.138 --> 00:01:45.145
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.867 --> 00:01:53.131
Think and answer. When could you use calm breathing?

22
00:01:53.181 --> 00:01:54.331
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.592 --> 00:02:00.433
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.483 --> 00:02:03.037
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

